---
export const prerender = true

import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro'

const machines = [
  { model: 'JLPTCSM-1300W', slug: 'automatic-printing-tubing-cutting-sewing-line', name: 'PP woven bag conversion line', note: 'printing, tubing, cutting and sewing in one continuous pass' },
  { model: 'JLRPM-6800BO/6C', slug: 'flexographic-printing-machine-6c', name: '6-colour flexographic printing machine', note: 'six ceramic anilox stations for PP woven fabric' },
  { model: 'JL-L-2TZP600', slug: 'hp-l-2tzp600-stand-up-zipper-pouch-machine', name: 'Multi-format pouch making machine', note: 'five pouch formats, full Panasonic servo control' },
  { model: 'JLECS-1000W', slug: 'eddy-current-non-ferrous-separator', name: 'Eddy current separator', note: 'non-ferrous metal recovery for recycling lines' },
  { model: '', slug: 'ai-machine-intelligence-solutions', name: 'AI Machine Intelligence', note: 'edge vision and servo compensation retrofitted to existing lines' },
]
---

<BaseLayout
  title="About Reylong — Plastic & Packaging Machinery Manufacturer"
  description="Rey Long has built plastic and packaging machinery in Yunlin, Taiwan for over 20 years. Our machines run in factories in more than 30 countries."
  alternateHref="https://www.reylong.com/es/about/"
>
  <div class="container-wide py-12">
    <h1>About Reylong</h1>

    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-2 gap-12 mt-8 items-start">
      <div class="prose prose-gray max-w-none">
        <p class="text-lg text-gray-700 leading-relaxed">
          Rey Long Machinery Co., Ltd. has been building plastic and packaging machinery in
          Douliu City, Yunlin County, Taiwan for over twenty years. Our machines run on
          production floors in more than thirty countries.
        </p>

        <h2>The machines we build</h2>
        <p>
          We manufacture around twenty machine models. This site shows a deliberately narrow
          selection of them — the specialty machines where our engineering makes the clearest
          difference, rather than the whole catalogue:
        </p>
        <ul>
          {machines.map(m => (
            <li>
              <a href={`/products/${m.slug}`}>
                {m.model ? <strong>{m.model}</strong> : <strong>{m.name}</strong>}
              </a>
              {m.model && <span> — {m.name}</span>}
              <span class="text-gray-600">. {m.note}.</span>
            </li>
          ))}
        </ul>
        <p>
          If the model you need is not on this list, ask us — there is a good chance we build it
          and simply have not put it on the website.
        </p>

        <h2>Complete production lines</h2>
        <p>
          A woven bag plant needs more than the machines we build ourselves. Tape extrusion lines,
          circular looms and lamination equipment are <strong>supplied and integrated through our
          partner factories</strong> rather than manufactured in-house. We say so plainly because
          the distinction matters when you are choosing a supplier — and because we still take
          responsibility for specifying the line and making every stage work together, whoever
          built each machine.
        </p>

        <h2>Why the machines are built where they are</h2>
        <p>
          Douliu sits at the southern end of Taiwan's central machinery belt, and that geography
          is practical rather than sentimental. Servo drives, gearboxes, pneumatics, controllers
          and precision-machined parts all have suppliers within a few hours' drive, which
          shortens the loop when a build needs a modification part-way through. It also shapes
          what goes inside the machines: the pouch line runs Panasonic servo control and a
          standard PLC touch-screen interface, for example, so the components a maintenance team
          is most likely to replace are ones they can source internationally rather than only
          from us. When a line has to run continuously, that matters more than it sounds like
          it should.
        </p>

        <h2>Where our machines run</h2>
        <p>
          Rey Long equipment operates in factories across Asia, Latin America, the Middle East,
          South Asia and Africa. We work with distributors and service partners in our main
          markets so that support does not depend on the distance to Taiwan.
        </p>

        <h2>After the machine ships</h2>
        <p>
          Every machine is delivered with full technical documentation, installation support and
          operator training. Most of our customers are running continuous, high-volume production,
          so what matters after commissioning is spare parts and someone who answers the phone —
          and that is what we organise around.
        </p>

        <h2>What helps when you ask for a specification</h2>
        <p>
          Specification conversations move faster when three things arrive with the enquiry: the
          bag or product format you need to produce, including dimensions and material structure;
          your target output per shift; and the electrical supply available at the site. Format
          and output together decide which model fits, while supply voltage and frequency decide
          what has to be changed before shipping. Photographs of the existing line help more than
          you might expect — most installations go into a plant that already has equipment, and
          how the new machine meets what is already there is usually the part that needs the most
          thought.
        </p>

        <h2>Where to find us</h2>
        <p>
          Rey Long Machinery Co., Ltd.<br />
          No. 3, Zhuwei Road, Douliu City, Yunlin County, Taiwan<br />
          Tel: <a href="tel:+886-5-5511888">+886-5-5511888</a><br />
          Email: <a href="mailto:t6960638@ms45.hinet.net">t6960638@ms45.hinet.net</a>
        </p>
      </div>

      <aside class="space-y-6">
        <div class="bg-gray-50 p-6 border-l-4 border-brand-red">
          <div class="text-4xl font-bold text-brand-red">20+</div>
          <div class="text-gray-600 mt-1">Years building machines in Taiwan</div>
        </div>
        <div class="bg-gray-50 p-6 border-l-4 border-brand-blue">
          <div class="text-4xl font-bold text-brand-blue">30+</div>
          <div class="text-gray-600 mt-1">Countries our machines run in</div>
        </div>
        <div class="bg-gray-50 p-6 border-l-4 border-gray-600">
          <div class="text-4xl font-bold text-gray-700">20</div>
          <div class="text-gray-600 mt-1">Machine models built — this site shows our specialty lines</div>
        </div>

        <div class="mt-6">
          <a href="/contact/" class="btn-primary w-full text-center block">Contact Our Team</a>
          <a href="/products" class="btn-secondary w-full text-center block mt-3">View All Products</a>
        </div>
      </aside>
    </div>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>
